    <string name="permissions_auto_launch_guide">The system does not report this state. ColorOS has two separate places: the autostart, associated launch and background activity switches in the app details (the row above), and the list under Settings > Apps > Auto launch (this row). Turn on 3-Chime Alarm in both, and AutoJs6 too when alarms start scripts, otherwise alarms do not ring once the plugin was closed in the background. When the list cannot open directly, this row opens Settings: go to Apps > Auto launch.</string>
